   43----  ****************** PILE GEOMETRY SECTION                                       
   44---- *   NGEN = 0   Pile head and tip coords given as (X1,Y1,Z1) and (X2,Y2,Z2)      
   45---- *   NGEN = N   Generate present pile from pile 'N' as specified by 'NSYM' code  
   46---- *   NSYM = 0   Present pile coords = Pile 'N' coords + (X1,Y1)                  
   47---- *   NSYM = 1   Symmetry w.r.t. global XZ-plane  (X1,Y1,...,Z2) not used         
   48---- *   NSYM = 2   Symmetry w.r.t. global YZ-plane  (X1,Y1,...,Z2) not used         
